[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "This so-called \"couple's seat\" doesn't seem that much wider than a single one.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "\"It's designed that way.\"",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Makes the two viewers sit a little closer together.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "So it's designed to make two people sit closer? Hmm, I can't complain about that.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Hmm, the designer really thought this through.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "[PlayerName], the movie's starting. Sit.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "(Sit down next to Wanshi.)",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Here, snacks.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Drinks.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "And your viewing glasses.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "I don't need any. My visual system can already simulate a virtual display.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Movie Background Audio",
        "ActorTalk": "I'm sorry, I only managed to save this one child. Can I leave her with you?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Movie Background Audio",
        "ActorTalk": "I checked her. She's alive and unhurt, just too weak to cry. Once you take her, just give her some water.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Movie Background Audio",
        "ActorTalk": "Don't worry about me. It's just a cut, nothing that'll get infected.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "Movie Background Audio",
        "ActorTalk": "...I don't need your promises anymore. Just go.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I'm fine, Wanshi.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "...Did you get hurt during yesterday's mission?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 19,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Sometimes your decisions are a little too reckless.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 20,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "I didn't get hurt at all, because I knew I'd be seeing you today.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 21,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Scenes like that, where people give up everything, won't ever happen to us as long as I'm here.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 22,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Those two in the movie... what a pity.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 23,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "If one of them had gone after the other, maybe things could've ended differently.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 24,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "What I mean is, people outside the movie still have their chance.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 25,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Before the Punishing, people used to confess their love\u2014or even propose\u2014during the most emotional scenes of a movie, or right after it ended.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 26,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "There are always things people can't say out loud in daily life, but in a place like this, it becomes easier to say them.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 27,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Commandant, you're the one who invited me today. Do you have something important you want to tell me?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 28,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I do, but I'm waiting for the right moment in the story.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 29,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "No plan yet. Maybe I'll say it if the story moves me enough.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 30,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "It's a secret.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 31,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh, I see. Let's keep watching then.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 32,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "One, two, three, four, five...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 33,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "That was a long five seconds. What did you think of that scene?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 34,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 35,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "That was the best part of the whole movie\u2014it really moved me. My favorite scene, hands down.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 36,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "If this feels like the right moment, then tell me what's on your mind.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 37,
        "ActorName": "Wanshi",
        "ActorTalk": "And in the next five seconds, I'll find my chance to give you my answer.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    }
]